<title>PORTUGAL: Banco Itau issues 5.0 bln esc, variable-rate bonds.</title>
<headline>Banco Itau issues 5.0 bln esc, variable-rate bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Itau Europa is issuing five billion escudos of variable-rate, three-year bonds on the domestic Portuguese market, joint-lead managers Banco Portugues de Investimento and Caixa Geral de Depositos said.</p>
<p>Subscription opens on November 25.</p>
<p>The issue pays six-month Lisbor plus 25 basis points.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
</text>
